{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:ClimaxVolumeMass.SelectionRuleC2Prediction","@type":"LeanModule","name":"ClimaxVolumeMass.SelectionRuleC2Prediction","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Real.Basic","lean:module:QOU.Mass.QHookDimension","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Order.Field.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.FieldSimp","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.Ring"],"declarations":4,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.selection_rule_c2_prediction_derived","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.selection_rule_c2_prediction_derived","kind":"theorem","line":78,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/climax-volume-mass/selection-rule-c2-prediction.lean#L78-L82","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:prop:selection-rule-c2-prediction","label":"prop:selection-rule-c2-prediction","md":"quantum-observable-universe/climax-volume-mass/selection-rule-c2-prediction.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.selection_rule_c2_prediction","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.selection_rule_c2_prediction","kind":"theorem","line":59,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/climax-volume-mass/selection-rule-c2-prediction.lean#L59-L69","doc":"**Composite c=2 prediction** — chains the sum-form and closed-form\nidentities into the full PR #1765 statement:\n\n`(1/3) · Σ_{λ⊢3} dim_q V_λ\n   = (dim_q V_(3) + dim_q V_(2,1) + dim_q V_(1,1,1)) / 3\n   = (1 + (q + q⁻¹) + 1) / 3\n   = (q+1)² / (3q)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.selection_rule_c2_eq_closed_form","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.selection_rule_c2_eq_closed_form","kind":"theorem","line":47,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/climax-volume-mass/selection-rule-c2-prediction.lean#L47-L57","doc":"**Selection rule at c=2 — closed form `(q+1)²/(3q)`**.\n\n`(2 + q + q⁻¹) / 3 = (q+1)² / (3q)` for real `q > 0` (equivalently `q ≠ 0`).\n\nThis is the algebraic identity supporting the framework's 2-component-link\nlinking_weight closed form: `lw(c=2) = (q+1)²/(3q)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.selection_rule_c2_sum_form","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.selection_rule_c2_sum_form","kind":"theorem","line":35,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/climax-volume-mass/selection-rule-c2-prediction.lean#L35-L45","doc":"**Selection rule at c=2 — q-form** (sum of H_3 q-dimensions over 3).\n\n`(1 + (q + q⁻¹) + 1) / 3 = (2 + q + q⁻¹) / 3`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}